.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH clip 1  "clip " 
.SH NAME
clip \- Control clipboard synchronization
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBqdrop clip\fR [\fB\-\-pause\fR] [\fB\-\-resume\fR] [\fB\-\-toggle\fR] [\fB\-\-status\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Control clipboard synchronization
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-pause\fR
Pause clipboard sync
.TP
\fB\-\-resume\fR
Resume clipboard sync
.TP
\fB\-\-toggle\fR
Flip between paused and active
.TP
\fB\-\-status\fR
Show clipboard sync status (the default)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
